---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Nova Concerns"
  description="Learn how we protect your personal and location data during tariff simulation and checkout processes."
>
  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <span class="badge badge-primary">Data Security</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last revised: October 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content glass">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect standard identification details (name, email address, telephone number) when you request a callback or request contract checkout. We also collect postcode parameters purely to simulate and output local 5G speeds.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Data Usage</h2>
        <p>
          Your contact information is used strictly to fulfill callback requests and send briefing newsletters. We do not sell, rent, or distribute personal data to third-party advertisers. All connection checking is done client-side and simulated location postcodes are not logged permanently.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Cookies and Storage</h2>
        <p>
          We use browser storage (localStorage) to persist items inside your Connection Cart between page reloads, ensuring a smooth navigation flow. No tracking pixels or third-party cookies are configured.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Personal information submitted via forms is held in secure databases only as long as necessary to complete the service request. Factual communications are encrypted in transit using industry-standard TLS protocols.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to request deletion of your contact records or opt out of our newsletter briefing at any time. To make a removal request, please contact our support team at <strong>info@novaconcerns.site</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.legal-section {
  padding: 6rem 0;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(var(--primary-rgb), 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);
}

.legal-container {
  max-width: 800px;
}

.legal-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
}

.legal-header h1 {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
}

.last-updated {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.legal-content {
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 3rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.75rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.legal-content h2 {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  color: #fff;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  margin-top: 1rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.legal-content p {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.legal-content strong {
  color: #fff;
}
</style>
